<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>3D-Printing Layered Interpretation — Cone</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#1b2a52;--ink-soft:#5a6a92;--paper:#fbfaf7;--grid:#dfe4ef;
    --accent:#c8842a;--accent-soft:#f0e0c6;--line:#9aa6c4;--dim:#aeb6cc;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
    font-family:"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
    background-image:linear-gradient(var(--grid) 1px,transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg,var(--grid) 1px,transparent 1px);
    background-size:26px 26px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:30px 20px 54px;}
  header{border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:13px;margin-bottom:22px;}
  .eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  h1{font-size:clamp(21px,4vw,32px);margin:6px 0 4px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  .sub{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14.5px;max-width:66ch;line-height:1.5;}

  .figs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:stretch;}
  @media(max-width:820px){.figs{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .fig{background:rgba(251,250,247,.85);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;
    padding:14px 14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:border-color .25s,box-shadow .25s;}
  .fig.lit{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(200,132,42,.18);}
  .fig h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600;}
  .fig svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;flex:1;}
  .fig .cap{font-family:"Cambria Math","Times New Roman",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;
    font-size:15px;text-align:center;margin-top:8px;color:var(--ink);}
  .fig .cap small{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:3px;}
  .var{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;}

  .chain{margin-top:22px;background:rgba(251,250,247,.9);border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:4px;padding:18px 16px;}
  .chain h2{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:600;}
  .eqline{font-family:"Cambria Math","Times New Roman",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;
    font-size:clamp(15px,2.4vw,20px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px;line-height:2;}
  .tok{padding:4px 8px;border-radius:3px;color:var(--dim);transition:all .25s;}
  .tok.shown{color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .tok.active{color:var(--ink);background:var(--accent-soft);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 var(--accent);}
  .eqsign{color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .intg{font-size:1.3em;vertical-align:-.16em;}
  sub,sup{font-size:.7em;}

  .step-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:16px 0 6px;}
  .step-num{font-family:"SFMono-Regular",Consolas,monospace;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);
    font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:3px 7px;}
  .step-title{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;}
  .step-body{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2c3a60;min-height:48px;}
  .step-body em{color:var(--accent);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;}

  .controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:22px;margin-top:14px;align-items:flex-end;}
  .ctrl{flex:1;min-width:200px;}
  .ctrl label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .ctrl label b{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--accent);}
  input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--ink);}
  .nav{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;}
  button{font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;}
  button:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);}
  button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">3D-Printing · Layered Interpretation</div>
    <h1>Building a cone from cylinder layers</h1>
    <p class="sub">The slide's logic, made interactive. Step through the chain — each term lights up its figure. The disk diameter shrinks with height by similar triangles: <em>x = D(1 &minus; r/H)</em>, full at the base and zero at the apex.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="figs">
    <!-- Figure 1: Cone -->
    <div class="fig" id="figCone">
      <h3>Figure 1 — the solid</h3>
      <svg id="svgCone" viewBox="0 0 220 230"></svg>
      <div class="cap">Cone(D,&thinsp;H)
        <small><span class="var">x</span> = D(1 &minus; r/H)</small>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Figure 2: Stacked cylinders -->
    <div class="fig" id="figCyl">
      <h3>Figure 2 — the layers</h3>
      <svg id="svgCyl" viewBox="0 0 260 300"></svg>
      <div class="cap">layer = Cylinder(<span class="var">x</span>,&thinsp;dH)
        <small>H / (D/2) = (H &minus; r) / (<span class="var">x</span>/2)</small>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Figure 3: Cross-section -->
    <div class="fig" id="figCircle">
      <h3>Figure 3 — one face</h3>
      <svg id="svgCircle" viewBox="0 0 220 210"></svg>
      <div class="cap">Circle(<span class="var">x</span>)
        <small><span class="var">x</span> = D(1 &minus; r/H)</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Equation chain + stepper -->
  <div class="chain">
    <h2>The equation, exactly as the slide builds it</h2>
    <div class="eqline">
      <span class="tok" id="tokA">Cone(D,&thinsp;H)</span>
      <span class="eqsign">=</span>
      <span class="tok" id="tokB"><span class="intg">&#8747;</span><sub>0</sub><sup>H</sup>&nbsp;Cylinder(<span class="var">x</span>,&thinsp;dH)&nbsp;dr</span>
      <span class="eqsign">=</span>
      <span class="tok" id="tokC"><span class="intg">&#8747;</span><sub>0</sub><sup>H</sup>&nbsp;Circle(<span class="var">x</span>)&middot;dH&nbsp;dr</span>
      <span class="eqsign">=</span>
      <span class="tok" id="tokD">dH&middot;<span class="intg">&#8747;</span><sub>0</sub><sup>H</sup>&nbsp;Circle(<span class="var">x</span>)&nbsp;dr</span>
    </div>

    <div class="step-head">
      <span class="step-num" id="sNum">1 / 4</span>
      <span class="step-title" id="sTitle"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="step-body" id="sBody"></div>

    <div class="controls">
      <div class="nav">
        <button id="prev">&larr; Back</button>
        <button id="next">Next &rarr;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="ctrl">
        <label>Layer thickness — number of layers <b><span id="nVal">10</span> (dH = H/<span id="nVal2">10</span>)</b></label>
        <input id="nLayers" type="range" min="3" max="60" value="10">
      </div>
      <div class="ctrl">
        <label>Pick a layer (height r) <b>r = <span id="rVal">0.0</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; x = <span id="xVal">10.0</span></b></label>
        <input id="rPick" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="20">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  const D=10, H=12;                         // base diameter, height
  const NS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
  const el=(t,a)=>{const e=document.createElementNS(NS,t);for(const k in a)e.setAttribute(k,a[k]);return e;};
  const xAt = r => D*(1 - r/H);             // similar triangles: diameter at height r

  const nIn=document.getElementById('nLayers');
  const rIn=document.getElementById('rPick');

  // small double-headed arrow helpers
  function vArrow(s,x,y1,y2,color){
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:x,y1:y1,x2:x,y2:y2,stroke:color,'stroke-width':1.2}));
    s.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${x} ${y1} l-4 6 l8 0 z`,fill:color}));
    s.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${x} ${y2} l-4 -6 l8 0 z`,fill:color}));
  }
  function hArrow(s,x1,x2,y,color){
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:x1,y1:y,x2:x2,y2:y,stroke:color,'stroke-width':1.2}));
    s.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${x1} ${y} l6 -4 l0 8 z`,fill:color}));
    s.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${x2} ${y} l-6 -4 l0 8 z`,fill:color}));
  }

  /* ---------- Figure 1: cone ---------- */
  function drawCone(){
    const s=document.getElementById('svgCone'); s.textContent='';
    const cx=110, apexY=28, baseY=180, baseR=78, baseRy=18;
    // base ellipse (back dashed, front solid)
    s.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${cx-baseR} ${baseY} A${baseR} ${baseRy} 0 0 1 ${cx+baseR} ${baseY}`,
      fill:'none',stroke:'var(--line)','stroke-width':1,'stroke-dasharray':'3 3'}));
    s.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${cx-baseR} ${baseY} A${baseR} ${baseRy} 0 0 0 ${cx+baseR} ${baseY}`,
      fill:'rgba(154,166,196,.10)',stroke:'var(--ink)','stroke-width':2}));
    // slant sides
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:cx,y1:apexY,x2:cx-baseR,y2:baseY,stroke:'var(--ink)','stroke-width':2}));
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:cx,y1:apexY,x2:cx+baseR,y2:baseY,stroke:'var(--ink)','stroke-width':2}));
    // H dashed centre line
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:cx,y1:apexY,x2:cx,y2:baseY,stroke:'var(--line)','stroke-width':1.2,'stroke-dasharray':'4 4'}));
    const th=el('text',{x:cx+8,y:(apexY+baseY)/2,fill:'var(--ink)','font-size':14,'font-style':'italic'}); th.textContent='H'; s.appendChild(th);
    // D label under base
    const td=el('text',{x:cx,y:baseY+34,'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'var(--ink)','font-size':14,'font-style':'italic'}); td.textContent='D'; s.appendChild(td);
    hArrow(s,cx-baseR,cx+baseR,baseY+22,'var(--ink-soft)');
  }

  /* ---------- Figure 2: stacked cylinders forming a cone ---------- */
  function drawCyl(){
    const s=document.getElementById('svgCyl'); s.textContent='';
    const cx=92, topY=46, botY=256, maxRpx=70;
    const N=+nIn.value, dH=H/N, hpx=(botY-topY)/N;
    const mapY = r => botY - r/H*(botY-topY);          // r=0 base bottom, r=H apex top
    const radPx = r => Math.max(0,(1 - r/H))*maxRpx;
    // pick layer
    const rPick=(+rIn.value/100)*H;
    const idx=Math.min(N-1,Math.max(0,Math.floor(rPick/dH)));
    const rC=(idx+0.5)*dH;

    // central axis
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:cx,y1:topY-6,x2:cx,y2:botY+6,stroke:'var(--line)','stroke-width':1,'stroke-dasharray':'3 4'}));

    // layers bottom -> top (pseudo-3D)
    for(let i=0;i<N;i++){
      const rc=(i+0.5)*dH, rad=radPx(rc), ry=Math.max(1.5,rad*0.26);
      const yc=mapY(rc), top=yc-hpx/2, bot=yc+hpx/2, hot=(i===idx);
      const fill=hot?'var(--accent-soft)':'rgba(154,166,196,.16)';
      const stroke=hot?'var(--accent)':'var(--line)', sw=hot?1.6:0.9;
      if(rad<0.5) continue;
      s.appendChild(el('rect',{x:cx-rad,y:top,width:2*rad,height:hpx,fill:'var(--paper)',stroke:'none'}));
      s.appendChild(el('rect',{x:cx-rad,y:top,width:2*rad,height:hpx,fill,stroke:'none'}));
      s.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${cx-rad} ${bot} A${rad} ${ry} 0 0 0 ${cx+rad} ${bot}`,fill:'none',stroke,'stroke-width':sw}));
      s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:cx-rad,y1:top,x2:cx-rad,y2:bot,stroke,'stroke-width':sw}));
      s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:cx+rad,y1:top,x2:cx+rad,y2:bot,stroke,'stroke-width':sw}));
      s.appendChild(el('ellipse',{cx,cy:top,rx:rad,ry,fill:hot?'var(--accent-soft)':'var(--paper)',stroke,'stroke-width':sw}));
    }

    // dH bracket on highlighted layer (left)
    const yc=mapY(rC), top=yc-hpx/2, bot=yc+hpx/2, bx=cx-maxRpx-14;
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:bx,y1:top,x2:bx,y2:bot,stroke:'var(--accent)','stroke-width':1.5}));
    [top,bot].forEach(yy=>s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:bx-4,y1:yy,x2:bx+4,y2:yy,stroke:'var(--accent)','stroke-width':1.5})));
    const tdh=el('text',{x:bx-6,y:(top+bot)/2+4,'text-anchor':'end',fill:'var(--accent)','font-size':12,'font-style':'italic'}); tdh.textContent='dH'; s.appendChild(tdh);

    // crosshair on the right: H (full), r (base->layer), x (horizontal)
    const ax=cx+maxRpx+44;
    vArrow(s,ax,topY,botY,'var(--ink-soft)');                       // H
    const tH=el('text',{x:ax+8,y:topY+10,fill:'var(--ink)','font-size':13,'font-style':'italic'}); tH.textContent='H'; s.appendChild(tH);
    // r from base to picked layer
    vArrow(s,ax-16,botY,yc,'var(--ink)');
    const tr=el('text',{x:ax-26,y:(botY+yc)/2+4,'text-anchor':'end',fill:'var(--ink)','font-size':13,'font-style':'italic'}); tr.textContent='r'; s.appendChild(tr);
    // x horizontal at picked layer height
    const xLen=(xAt(rC)/D)*46;
    hArrow(s,ax-xLen,ax+xLen,yc,'var(--ink)');
    const tx=el('text',{x:ax,y:yc-7,'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'var(--ink)','font-size':13,'font-style':'italic'}); tx.textContent='x'; s.appendChild(tx);
    // baseline D
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:cx-maxRpx,y1:botY+18,x2:ax+24,y2:botY+18,stroke:'var(--ink-soft)','stroke-width':1}));
    const tD=el('text',{x:cx-maxRpx+8,y:botY+32,fill:'var(--ink)','font-size':13,'font-style':'italic'}); tD.textContent='D'; s.appendChild(tD);

    return {rC};
  }

  /* ---------- Figure 3: cross-section circle ---------- */
  function drawCircle(rC){
    const s=document.getElementById('svgCircle'); s.textContent='';
    const cx=110, cy=100, maxR=82;
    const x=xAt(rC), rr=Math.max(0.5,(x/D)*maxR);
    s.appendChild(el('circle',{cx,cy,r:rr,fill:'var(--accent-soft)',stroke:'var(--accent)','stroke-width':2}));
    s.appendChild(el('line',{x1:cx-rr,y1:cy,x2:cx+rr,y2:cy,stroke:'var(--ink)','stroke-width':1.3}));
    [-1,1].forEach(sgn=>{const tx=cx+sgn*rr;
      s.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${tx} ${cy} l${-sgn*8} -4 m${sgn*8} 4 l${-sgn*8} 4`,stroke:'var(--ink)','stroke-width':1.3,fill:'none'}));});
    const t=el('text',{x:cx,y:cy-8,'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'var(--ink)','font-size':15,'font-style':'italic'}); t.textContent='x'; s.appendChild(t);
    return x;
  }

  function render(){
    drawCone();
    const {rC}=drawCyl();
    const x=drawCircle(rC);
    const N=+nIn.value;
    document.getElementById('nVal').textContent=N;
    document.getElementById('nVal2').textContent=N;
    document.getElementById('rVal').textContent=rC.toFixed(1);
    document.getElementById('xVal').textContent=x.toFixed(1);
  }
  nIn.addEventListener('input',render);
  rIn.addEventListener('input',render);

  /* ---------- stepper ---------- */
  const steps=[
    {tok:'tokA',figs:['figCone'],title:"Start with the cone",
      body:"The object is a solid cone of base diameter <em>D</em> and height <em>H</em>. Everything below just rewrites its volume, <em>Cone(D, H)</em>, into something we can integrate."},
    {tok:'tokB',figs:['figCyl'],title:"Slice into cylinder layers",
      body:"Stack flat layers of thickness <em>dH</em> from the base (<em>r = 0</em>) up to the apex (<em>r = H</em>). Each layer is a <em>Cylinder(x, dH)</em>, and by similar triangles its diameter is <em>x = D(1 &minus; r/H)</em> — wide at the base, zero at the tip."},
    {tok:'tokC',figs:['figCyl'],title:"A cylinder is its face times dH",
      body:"Rewrite each layer as <em>Circle(x)&middot;dH</em>: the area of the circular face times the layer thickness. Same volume, expanded notation."},
    {tok:'tokD',figs:['figCircle'],title:"Factor out dH",
      body:"Every layer has the same thickness <em>dH</em>, so it comes outside the integral. What remains integrates the cross-section <em>Circle(x)</em> over the height."}
  ];
  let i=0;
  const toks=['tokA','tokB','tokC','tokD'];
  const figIds=['figCone','figCyl','figCircle'];
  function showStep(){
    const s=steps[i];
    document.getElementById('sNum').textContent=(i+1)+" / "+steps.length;
    document.getElementById('sTitle').textContent=s.title;
    document.getElementById('sBody').innerHTML=s.body;
    toks.forEach((id,k)=>{const e=document.getElementById(id);e.classList.remove('active','shown');if(k<i)e.classList.add('shown');});
    document.getElementById(s.tok).classList.add('active');
    figIds.forEach(f=>document.getElementById(f).classList.remove('lit'));
    s.figs.forEach(f=>document.getElementById(f).classList.add('lit'));
    document.getElementById('prev').disabled=(i===0);
    document.getElementById('next').disabled=(i===steps.length-1);
  }
  document.getElementById('next').onclick=()=>{if(i<steps.length-1){i++;showStep();}};
  document.getElementById('prev').onclick=()=>{if(i>0){i--;showStep();}};

  render(); showStep();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
